            <div xml:id="d491">

                <pb facs="0678" n="578" sameAs="frus:frus1934v02/pg578"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">251.11 Insull, Samuel/462: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Skinner</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ankara</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-03-31T16:00:00+02:00">March 31, 1934—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received March 31—11:10 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>24. Documents Insull case received and delivered before noon. I hope for
                    favorable court action but there may be some delay. Meantime Insull is being
                    detained.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Skinner</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
